    "text": "UII KALENDAS MAI, PASSIO SANCTI MARCI EUANGELISTE.\nMARCVS SE GODSPELLERE BE GODES DIHTE GEFOR TO AEGIPta lande and \u00f0\u00e6r l\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t\nHe ferde \u00fea geond eall \u00f0\u00e6t aegiptisce land sawende Godes s\u00e6d, and \u00f0a seocan geh\u00e6lde.\nHreoflige he gecl\u00e6nsode fram \u00f0\u00e6re uncl\u00e6nan co\u00f0e, wode he geh\u00e6lde and on witte gebrohte, and\n\u00dea gelyfdon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan on \u00f0one so\u00f0an H\u00e6lend and wurdon gefullode, and towurpon heora deofolgild.\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6t nextan geneosod \u00feurh God, and se halga gast het hine faran to Alexandrian byrig, and\nSeo burh is m\u00e6rost mid Egyptiscum mancynne.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea se godspellere gegrette his gebro\u00f0ra, and s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend hine hete faran to Alexandrian\nHi \u00fea sona eoden to scipe mid him, and b\u00e6don God georne \u00fe\u00e6t he his weg gewissode.\nHe ferde \u00f0a on scipe, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he gesundful becom to Alexandrian byrig, and bodode \u00f0\u00e6r geleafan, and\nSum sutere siwode \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres sceos, and \u00f0urh\u00feide his hand hetelice swy\u00fee, ac se halga wer hine\nAnianus w\u00e6s gehaten se ylca sutere, and he ge\u00feeah swa for gode, \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere hine gesette \u00feam\nHe gehadode eac \u00fea \u00f0ry messepreostas, and seofon diaconas and endleofan clericas.\n\u00dea syrwdon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan and hine beswican woldon, for\u00fean \u00fee he awende heora gewunelican \u00f0eawas,\n\u00dea ferde se godspellere fram \u00f0\u00e6re byrig, to \u00f0am geleaffullum \u00f0e he \u00e6r l\u00e6rde, and \u00f0\u00e6r \u00feurhwunode wel\nHi h\u00e6fdon eac ar\u00e6red on hr\u00e6dincge ane cyrcan, and weox se geleafa, and Godes wuldor scean.\n\u00dea worhte Marcus myccle wundra, he geh\u00e6lde untrume on \u00f0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman, blinde and deafe, and\n\u00dea com seo halige eastertid, and \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan cepton hw\u00e6r se godspellere m\u00e6ssode, and m\u00e6rsode his\nBecnytton \u00f0a his swuran sona mid rape, and tugon geond \u00f0a str\u00e6t, swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea stanas w\u00e6ron mid his\n\u00dea si\u00f0\u00f0an on \u00e6fentiman hi setton hine on cweartern, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi be\u00f0ohton hu hi hine acwealdon.\nEfne \u00fea on middere nihte wear\u00f0 mycel eor\u00f0styrung, and Godes encgel fleah f\u00e6rlice to \u00feam cwearterne,\n\u00dea astrehte se halga his handa and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic \u00f0ancie \u00f0e, Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u me ne forlete, ac gemundest min\nIc bidde \u00fee nu, H\u00e6lend Crist, onfoh mine sawle on sibbe, and ne ge\u00f0afa \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ic beo fram \u00f0e ascired.\nMid \u00feam \u00f0e he \u00feis cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fea com Crist sylf him to, on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan gelicnysse \u00fee he leofode on worulde,\nAnd Marcus him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Min Drihten H\u00e6lend; and se h\u00e6lend si\u00f0ode sona to heofonum.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea on \u00e6rnemerigen comon \u00f0a arleasan h\u00e6\u00f0enan, and becnytton his swuran eft sona mid rape, and\nAnd he gewat mid \u00feam worde of worulde to Gode, mid \u00f0am he a blyssa\u00f0 butan earfo\u00f0nyssum.\n\u00dea woldon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan his lic forbernan and worhten mycel ad, ac hit wear\u00f0 adw\u00e6sced, swa \u00fe\u00e6t God\nComon \u00fea sy\u00f0\u00f0an sona \u00fea Cristenan, eawf\u00e6ste weras and hi aweg feredon \u00fe\u00e6s godspelleres lic, and\nAMEN.\nITEM ALIA.\nWe habba\u00fe nu ges\u00e6d sceortlice on \u00f0ysum gewryte hu se halga Marcus w\u00e6s gemartyrod.\nNu wylle we eow secgan hu se halga Hieronimus be \u00f0am feower godspellerum, \u00f0e Gode gecorene\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Lucas s\u00e6de, swa swa hit ful so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t manega menn ongunnon godspel to writenne\nBe swilcum cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend eac on sumere stowe, Warnia\u00f0 eow georne wi\u00f0 lease witegan, \u00fea \u00f0e\nAc seo geleaffulle gela\u00f0ung \u00fee is gelogod on Criste, and on him gef\u00e6stnod, swa swa on f\u00e6stum stane,\nSe forma godspellere is, \u00fee gode gecoren w\u00e6s, Matheus gehaten, \u00feone se h\u00e6lend geceas of\nHe awrat hi on Ebreisc \u00feam Ebreiscum mannum \u00f0e on Iudea lande gelyfdon on Criste, and wolde min\n\u00dea wolde he on \u00e6r his agenre leode \u00fe\u00e6t godspell awritan, \u00e6r\u00f0am \u00fee he gewende him fram.\nSe o\u00f0er godspellere is Marcus, \u00fee w\u00e6s mid \u00feam apostole Petre getogen on lare, and to geleafan\nPetrus w\u00e6s his godf\u00e6der and hine gode gestrynde, and he swa lange folgode his fulluhtf\u00e6dere Petre,\nNe geseah he Crist on life, ac he leornode swa\u00f0eah of Petres bodunge hu he \u00f0a boc gesette, and Petrus\nSe \u00f0ridda godspellere is Lucas, se w\u00e6s l\u00e6ce on worulde, and wunode mid \u00f0am apostolum and mid\nHe awrat his godspell on Achaian lande, and gewat to Gode mid \u00f0am halgan gaste afylled, \u00f0a \u00fea he\nSe feor\u00f0a godspellere is Iohannes Cristes moddrian sunu, se w\u00e6s Criste swa leof \u00fe\u00e6t he hlynode\nHe w\u00e6s \u00e6rest gecoren eallra \u00fe\u00e6ra godspellera, ac he is for\u00f0i se feor\u00f0a for\u00fean \u00fee he sette \u00fea feor\u00f0an\nOn asia he w\u00e6s \u00fea he awrat \u00fea boc, and he leofode lange on life \u00e6fter Criste, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea o\u00f0re apostolas\n\u00d0as feower godspelleras syndon Gode gecorene, and hi ealne middaneard mid heora lare onlihton,\nHe geseah on his gesih\u00f0e swylce feower nytenu; An \u00fe\u00e6ra feower nytena w\u00e6s gesewen swilce mannes\n\u00dees mannes gelicnyss belimp\u00f0 to mathee, for\u00f0an \u00fee he ongan his godspell be Cristes menniscnysse.\nSe leo belimp\u00f0, swa swa \u00fea geleaffullan secga\u00fe, to Marces gelicnysse, for\u00f0an \u00fee he hlud swege\n\u00de\u00e6s celfes gelicnyss belimp\u00f0 to Lucan, for\u00f0an \u00fee he ongan his godspell, swa swa God him gedihte,\n\u00de\u00e6s earnes gelicnys belimp\u00f0 to Iohanne, for\u00f0an \u00fee se earn flyh\u00f0 ealra fugela ufemest, and m\u00e6g\nSwa dyde Iohannes se drihtwur\u00f0a writere; he fleah feor upp, swylce mid earnes fy\u00f0erum, and beheold\nSe fores\u00e6da witega s\u00e6de on his gesih\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6ra feower nytena fet w\u00e6ron rihte, and hi eodon \u00e6fre\n\u00deus is on \u00f0\u00e6re ealdan \u00e6 awriten be \u00f0am godspellerum, and eft on \u00f0\u00e6re niwan gecy\u00f0nysse \u00e6fter\nApocalypsis seo boc be \u00f0is ylcum seg\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Iohannes gesawe \u00fea fores\u00e6dan nytenu, on \u00feam ylcan hiwe\nSe halga sang geswutela\u00f0 \u00fea halgan \u00ferynnysse on anre godcundnysse \u00e6fre wunigende, seo \u00f0e \u00e6fre\nNu we habba\u00f0 ges\u00e6d on \u00f0isre sceortnysse, hu God geswutelode \u00fea so\u00f0f\u00e6stan godspelleras on \u00fe\u00e6re\nWe geendia\u00f0 \u00feus \u00f0as gesetnysse her.",
